Package: tracebounds
Title: Prototype Data and Bounds for Informative Political Traces
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Gary Ziwen", "Zu", email = "zzu@utk.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Research prototype for standardized political trace data,
    explicit multistage simulation, exact special-case identification,
    conservative sampling projection, and abstaining comparisons.
    Does not implement the general anchored joint sharp-set optimizer.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
